    },
    "message": "Move the staff operation, support, travel, toilet, timeout, effect facility and social texts, and test them\n\nThe kernels of the staff operation events, staff support completion, a walk's first checks, a\ntoilet visit's, a support timeout, an EffectProgram's facility modifier and a typed social event's\nfirst checks raise the Python rule's texts in its order. The dispatch loop records those its direct\ncalls raise. Tests that asserted a refusal now assert the kernel's own text equals the Python rule's.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01K4QyYRukuCLBerKa4UYj4y",
